    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to:"
  },
