  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#931;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>&#931;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#931;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
